{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DpQhUxiUrkiLasTyGjzM5U","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# gen-depth-fingerprint — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 18:12 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP: research 阶段启动，引用 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n估计文本的\\\\\\\"生成深度\\\\\\\"（gen-0 / gen-1 / gen-2+），实现风险分层数据治理。非释义生成链打破 attractor 收敛约束，分布漂移随深度累积，留下可检测的\\\\\\\"分布指纹\\\\\\\"。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-14 通过，macro-F1=0.84，binary-F1=0.87）\\\\n- **服务器**: autodl-5090 (4× RTX 5090 32GB)\\\\n- **Venue**: AAAI 2027 (DDL Aug 2) primary / EMNLP 2026 ARR (May 25) stretch\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260514T181213 pending（full review mode）\\\\n- **覆盖率**: MVP 验证了 Claim 1 单生成器场景；Claim 2/3 待验证\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (from paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. **Depth Discriminability** — 分布特征能跨生成器区分 gen-0/gen-1/gen-2+\\\\n2. **Distributional Fingerprint Independence** — 参考模型特征独立于表面词汇统计\\\\n3. **Downstream Utility** — 深度感知过滤优于二分类过滤\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划 (from experiment_plan.yaml)\\\\n| ID | Name | Claim | Pri | GPU·h | Status |\\\\n|----|------|-------|-----|-------|--------|\\\\n| mvp-001 | mvp_validation | 1 | — | 3 | ✅ DONE |\\\\n| plan_001 | feature_ablation | 2 | P0 | 1 | pending |\\\\n| plan_002 | cross_generator_evaluation | 1 | P0 | 20 | pending |\\\\n| plan_003 | cross_family_reference_model | 1 | P0 | 8 | pending |\\\\n| plan_004 | downstream_utility | 3 | P0 | 15 | pending |\\\\n| plan_005 | prompt_type_comparison | 1 | P1 | 10 | pending |\\\\n| plan_006 | paraphrastic_comparison | 1 | P1 | 8 | pending |\\\\n| plan_007 | cross_model_chains | 1 | P1 | 12 | pending |\\\\n| plan_008 | multi_domain_seeds | 1 | P1 | 10 | pending |\\\\n| plan_009-012 | P2 experiments | 1,2 | P2 | 23 | pending |\\\\n\\\\n**GPU 预算**: P0 ~44h / P1 ~40h / P2 ~23h / Total ~107h (≤200h budget)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 回调 → 分析审稿反馈 → 决定是否调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后：批准 plan_001 (feature_ablation) — 用现有 MVP 数据，无需新 generation\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 结果确认 Claim 2 后：批准 plan_002 (cross_generator，需下载 4 个新模型)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n本项目分配: autodl-5090 4× RTX 5090 (32GB)\\\\n已用: ~3 GPU·h (MVP generation + feature extraction)\\\\n剩余: ~197 GPU·h\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 framing 调整：从 \\\\\\\"Fingerprint Independence\\\\\\\" 转为 | plan_001 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 准备 Plan B framing：若 ablation 显示表面特征足够，叙事从  | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-14 | MVP PASS → 进入研究阶段。首要任务：特征 ablation + depth signal  | mvp-001 |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-14 | MVP 方案：Pythia-2.8B continuation 链 + Pythia-410M 参考 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2298, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YGeXb4ty17UBDggEnQBE1o","session_id":"ad9f5738-9994-4640-8a26-12b004b49048","uuid":"fa471a92-723a-4fc0-bfdf-2f74a671b2c2","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:59:16.864Z"}
